<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA VERSUS AUSTRALIA MATCH ABANDONED BECAUSE OF RAIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA VERSUS AUSTRALIA MATCH ABANDONED BECAUSE OF RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>CUTTACK, India 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Titan Cup triangular</p>
<p>one-day series match between India and Australia on Sunday was</p>
<p>abandoned because of rain.</p>
<p>The teams were awarded one point each.</p>
</text>
